<title>UK: SBC sets call warrants on German blue chips.</title>
<headline>SBC sets call warrants on German blue chips.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Schweizerischer Bankverein (Deutschland) AG has issued 13 million American-style call warrants, in 13 equal tranches, on various German blue chips, lead manager SBC Warburg said.</p>
<p>The underlying consists of Adidas, BASF, Commerzbank, Daimler-Benz, Deutsche Bank, Hoechst, Lufthansa, Schering, Mannesmann, Volkswagen (two tranches), Chemiebasket and Autobasket.  Denomnated in Swiss francs there are various maturity dates.</p>
<p>COMMON TERMS:</p>
<p> PAYDATE	   05.FEB.07		MIN EXER LOT 10</p>
<p>-- Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
